296
00:18:49,437 --> 00:18:50,836
And here is the detail that gets me.

297
00:18:51,021 --> 00:18:53,992
It not just pretty, it's
mathematically obsessive.

298
00:18:54,648 --> 00:19:00,514
The four minarets lean slightly outward
