310
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,452
decision that tells you everything.

311
00:19:43,973 --> 00:19:44,983
He didn't kill his father.

312
00:19:45,271 --> 00:19:48,682
He locked him in the fort at Agra
for the last eight years of his

313
00:19:48,682 --> 00:19:52,457
