318
00:20:06,988 --> 00:20:09,051
It was only beginning of
the end for two reasons.

319
00:20:09,288 --> 00:20:11,071
The first was the policy.

320
00:20:11,344 --> 00:20:16,353
He reversed Akbar's approach and
brought back the jizya tax, non-Muslim,

321
00:20:16,387 --> 00:20:18,651
and took a harder religious line.

322
00:20:18,875 --> 00:20:22,197
In an empire where the overwhelming
majority of subjects were Hindu,

323
00:20:22,502 --> 00:20:25,041
that turned a lot quite religion loud

324
00:20:28,295 --> 00:20:29,864
The second one was the Deccan.

325
00:20:30,339 --> 00:20:34,985
He went south to finish off his
enemy, spent the last 27 years

326
00:20:34,987 --> 00:20:36,895
of his life down there camping.

327
00:20:37,917 --> 00:20:42,992
And he won battles constantly and never
won the war because his main opponents

328
00:20:42,993 --> 00:20:45,359
