331
00:20:56,900 --> 00:21:02,833
Aurangzeb died in 1707 at
88 in a tent in the Deccan.

332
00:21:03,384 --> 00:21:07,722
Having the drained richest treasury in
the world, he left instructions that his

333
00:21:07,733 --> 00:21:12,584
