351
00:22:16,395 --> 00:22:19,809
One robbery, three years
of national tax holiday.

352
00:22:20,176 --> 00:22:23,509
The Mughal Empire technically
continued for another one hundred and

353
00:22:23,511 --> 00:22:26,472
twenty years, but only technically.

354
00:22:27,474 --> 00:22:29,565
Real power broke apart across the map.

355
00:22:29,742 --> 00:22:34,072
The Marathas, those raiders from the
Deccan, became the biggest force in India

356
00:22:34,072 --> 00:22:36,732
and pushed all the way to the Delhi.

357
00:22:37,100 --> 00:22:43,163
And in 1761 at Panipat, the same field
