359
00:22:48,555 --> 00:22:50,840
Tens of thousands of dead in a single day.

360
00:22:50,896 --> 00:22:55,129
It didn't destroy them, but it broke
the momentum at the exact point they

361
00:22:55,130 --> 00:22:57,041
