362
00:22:57,397 --> 00:22:59,427
So now picture the board.

363
00:23:00,093 --> 00:23:01,589
The old empire is a shell.

364
00:23:02,090 --> 00:23:05,192
The strongest challenger
had just been mauled.

365
00:23:05,427 --> 00:23:09,054
Dozens of regional powers are
circling each other, and every

366
00:23:09,054 --> 00:23:12,764
one of them needs money and modern
weapons to fight the others.

367
00:23:13,421 --> 00:23:17,581
And sitting on the coast with money
and modern weapons is a business.

368
00:23:17,908 --> 00:23:22,479
Not a country, a business with
shareholders who are in London

369
00:23:25,541 --> 00:23:29,815
The East India Company arrived
in 1600s to trade cotton, silk,

370
00:23:29,965 --> 00:23:32,341
spices, saltpetre and tea.

371
00:23:32,663 --> 00:23:36,300
For about 150 years, that's
genuinely all it did.

372
00:23:37,020 --> 00:23:41,603
From a fortified coastal warehouse with
permission from Indian rulers, then

373
00:23:41,603 --> 00:23:45,992
it noticed that Indian rulers were now
fighting each other constantly and that

374
00:23:46,027 --> 00:23:51,172
both sides, uh, in any given fight would
