started picking who the ruler was.

377
00:24:00,036 --> 00:24:03,437
The turning point was Bengal in 1757.

378
00:24:03,817 --> 00:24:09,978
Bengal was richest province in India
and its young ruler, Siraj ud-Daulah,

379
00:24:10,137 --> 00:24:13,679
was fed up with the company fortifying
its base without permission, so

380
00:24:14,051 --> 00:24:15,693
