00:26:31,905 --> 00:26:36,473
57. Most of the company's
army in India were Indians.

422
00:26:37,130 --> 00:26:41,049
Hundreds of thousands of Indian
soldiers were called sepoys with a

423
00:26:41,049 --> 00:26:42,934
thin layer of British officers on top.

424
00:26:44,509 --> 00:26:47,070
There was already a
long list of grievances.

425
00:26:47,467 --> 00:26:50,741
Kingdom were being a-annexed
