00:27:21,525 --> 00:27:24,891
One cartridge managed to
offend essentially everybody.

436
00:27:25,254 --> 00:27:30,591
Whether the rumor was true has been argued
for about hundred and seventy years.

437
00:27:30,638 --> 00:27:31,331
It didn't matter.

438
00:27:31,736 --> 00:27:32,531
Men believed it.

439
00:27:32,908 --> 00:27:35,735
They believed it because they
already believed everything else.

440
00:27:35,864 --> 00:27:42,184
In March 1857, a sepoy named Mangal Pandey
