444
00:27:55,370 --> 00:28:00,742
ei-eighty-two years old Mughal Empire-
Emperor Bahadur Shah Jafar their leader.

445
00:28:01,259 --> 00:28:02,393
Jafar was a poet.

446
00:28:02,553 --> 00:28:03,467
He wrote in Urdu.

447
00:28:04,231 --> 00:28:08,161
He was frail, and he had been
living on British pensions in

448
00:28:08,228 --> 00:28:10,098
