449
00:28:10,327 --> 00:28:11,464
He did not ask for this.

450
00:28:11,611 --> 00:28:14,458
He was handed an empire
he had no ability to run.

451
00:28:15,271 --> 00:28:19,636
The fighting lasted for more than a
