452
00:28:19,649 --> 00:28:25,524
The British retook Delhi,
and the reprisals was brutal.

453
00:28:26,118 --> 00:28:27,879
Jafar's sons were shot.

454
00:28:28,351 --> 00:28:35,554
He was on trial, exiled to Rangoon in
Burma, and when he died in 1862 and

455
00:28:35,554 --> 00:28:41,216
was buried in an unmarked grave so that
his tomb could never become a shrine.

456
00:28:41,930 --> 00:28:45,538
He wrote a line in exile about
the misfortune of a man who

